  "desc": "A musique-concrete cloud of cut-up speech: alphabet letters, slurred words and speechless syllables scattered across the stereo field at drifting speeds, unpitched and drumless. Sparse is a thin drift; full swells its letter grid from three hits to a full eight-step cloud over four cycles; peak layers alphabet, reversed speech, speechless splices and ades fragments into a dense uncanny wash under long reverb. Never a beat, only voices condensing and thinning.",
